#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of the available plans, including Pay-As-You-Go, Premium, and Open"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan pelan yang tersedia, termasuk Pay-As-You-Go, Premium, dan Open"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plans overview"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan pelan"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-plans\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-plans\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plans overview {#plans-overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan pelan {#plans-overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Platform has Open (free access) and paid plans, as described below. See [IBM Quantum access plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) for full details.\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Platform menawarkan pelan Open (akses percuma) dan pelan berbayar, seperti yang diterangkan di bawah. Lihat [pelan akses IBM Quantum](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/pricing) untuk maklumat penuh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want access to multiple plans, you can create multiple instances and assign different plans to them.  For example, you can have an Open Plan instance and a Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance.  You can set preferred instances to use in the `QiskitRuntimeService` initializer or `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()` method.  Example:\n"
msgstr "Jika anda mahu akses kepada berbilang pelan, anda boleh mencipta berbilang instance dan menetapkan pelan berbeza kepada setiap satu. Contohnya, anda boleh mempunyai instance Pelan Open dan instance Pelan Pay-As-You-Go. Anda boleh menetapkan instance pilihan untuk digunakan dalam pemulaan `QiskitRuntimeService` atau kaedah `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`. Contoh:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan {#open-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan Open {#open-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run your quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs for free (up to 10 minutes per 28-day rolling window). You can track your usage on the [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) pages.  Open Plan instances can only be created in the us-east region (you can switch regions from the drop-down menu at the top of the Platform dashboard). [Click to go the sign-up page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"
msgstr "Jalankan litar kuantum anda pada QPU terbaik di dunia secara percuma (sehingga 10 minit bagi setiap tempoh bergulir 28 hari). Anda boleh menjejak penggunaan anda pada halaman [papan pemuka Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) dan [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads). Instance Pelan Open hanya boleh dicipta di rantau us-east (anda boleh menukar rantau daripada menu juntai bawah di bahagian atas papan pemuka Platform). [Klik untuk pergi ke halaman pendaftaran](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who are learning quantum computing and exploring IBM quantum technology.\n"
msgstr "Pelan ini disyorkan bagi mereka yang sedang belajar pengkomputeran kuantum dan meneroka teknologi kuantum IBM.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Limited time promotion\">\n"
"As of 16 March 2026, active Open Plan users can opt in to an additional 180 minutes over the next 12 months.\n"
"Read the [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) blog for full details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Promosi masa terhad\">\n"
"Mulai 16 Mac 2026, pengguna Pelan Open yang aktif boleh memilih untuk menyertai tambahan 180 minit sepanjang 12 bulan akan datang.\n"
"Baca blog [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates) untuk maklumat penuh.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flex Plan {#flex-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan Flex {#flex-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pre-purchase a certain number of minutes (at least 400) for running quantum jobs, to be used within one year of purchase.  You can purchase more minutes at any time.\n"
msgstr "Beli terlebih dahulu bilangan minit tertentu (sekurang-kurangnya 400) untuk menjalankan kerja kuantum, untuk digunakan dalam tempoh satu tahun dari tarikh pembelian. Anda boleh membeli lebih banyak minit pada bila-bila masa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After purchasing time, you must allocate the minutes to existing or new instances on the Flex Plan for your account.  Set or update allocation limits on the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) or set the allocation when you [create a new Flex Plan instance](/guides/instances).  If you allocate all of the minutes to existing instances, you can't create a new instance for the Flex Plan until you purchase more minutes or remove some minutes from another instance's allocation. See [Set instance allocation limits](allocation-limits) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Selepas membeli masa, anda perlu memperuntukkan minit kepada instance sedia ada atau baharu pada Pelan Flex untuk akaun anda. Tetapkan atau kemas kini had peruntukan pada [halaman Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) atau tetapkan peruntukan semasa anda [mencipta instance Pelan Flex baharu](/guides/instances). Jika anda memperuntukkan semua minit kepada instance sedia ada, anda tidak boleh mencipta instance baharu untuk Pelan Flex sehingga anda membeli lebih banyak minit atau mengeluarkan beberapa minit daripada peruntukan instance lain. Lihat [Tetapkan had peruntukan instance](allocation-limits) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you need more than 10,000 minutes, you should consider a Premium Plan subscription instead. If you don't want to purchase 400 minutes, consider the Pay-As-You-Go Plan instead.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda memerlukan lebih daripada 10,000 minit, anda patut mempertimbangkan langganan Pelan Premium. Jika anda tidak mahu membeli 400 minit, pertimbangkan Pelan Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to sign up for a Flex Plan.\n"
msgstr "[Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk mendaftar Pelan Flex.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan Pay-As-You-Go {#pay-as-you-go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs and pay only for the QPU consumption you use.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan litar kuantum pada QPU terbaik di dunia dan bayar hanya untuk penggunaan QPU yang anda gunakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who are performing quantum utility research projects and testing business models with flexible access. If you will be using at least 400 minutes in the next year, it is recommended that you use the Flex Plan instead.\n"
msgstr "Pelan ini disyorkan bagi mereka yang menjalankan projek penyelidikan utiliti kuantum dan menguji model perniagaan dengan akses yang fleksibel. Jika anda akan menggunakan sekurang-kurangnya 400 minit dalam tahun hadapan, adalah disyorkan agar anda menggunakan Pelan Flex.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium Plan {#premium-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan Premium {#premium-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs using an enterprise subscription. Additionally, some functionality, such as [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), is available to Premium Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan litar kuantum pada QPU terbaik di dunia menggunakan langganan peringkat enterprise. Selain itu, beberapa fungsi, seperti [Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions), tersedia untuk pengguna Pelan Premium.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This plan is recommended for those who want to execute a strategic quantum roadmap and develop quantum algorithms and applications at scale. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Pelan ini disyorkan bagi mereka yang ingin melaksanakan peta jalan kuantum strategik dan membangunkan algoritma serta aplikasi kuantum pada skala besar. [Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "On-Prem Plan {#on-prem-plan}"
msgstr "Pelan On-Prem {#on-prem-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access an entirely dedicated on-premises quantum system that is serviced and maintained by IBM Quantum.\n"
msgstr "Akses sistem kuantum dalam premis yang sepenuhnya khusus (dedicated), yang diservis dan diselenggarakan oleh IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This service is recommended for those who are exploring classical quantum algorithms and applications and need high control over their resources and data. [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to learn more.\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan ini disyorkan bagi mereka yang meneroka algoritma dan aplikasi klasikal-kuantum serta memerlukan kawalan tinggi ke atas sumber dan data mereka. [Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Compare available plans](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Understand what counts as [usage](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Learn about the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  Access plans by creating [instances](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Upgrade from the Open Plan](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"  -  [Bandingkan pelan yang tersedia](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products).\n"
"  -  Fahami apa yang dikira sebagai [penggunaan](/guides/estimate-job-run-time).\n"
"  -  Ketahui tentang [penjadual fair-share](/guides/fair-share-scheduler)\n"
"  -  Akses pelan dengan mencipta [instance](/guides/instances).\n"
"  -  [Naik taraf daripada Pelan Open](/guides/upgrade-from-open).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
